1
00:00:00,373 --> 00:00:02,203
(Sheldon:)I can't believe
you're not on my side.

2
00:00:02,208 --> 00:00:06,478
(Sheldon:)I was on your side when someone
stole your car radio.

3
00:00:07,613 --> 00:00:10,913
(Amy:)Who else's side
could you have been on?

4
00:00:10,917 --> 00:00:13,017
(Howard:)I don't know.

5
00:00:13,019 --> 00:00:16,219
(Sheldon:)A music-loving hobo
with a heart of gold?

6
00:00:17,523 --> 00:00:19,353
(Amy:)Sheldon, I understand
that you're upset

7
00:00:19,358 --> 00:00:21,028
(Amy:)because you feel left out,

8
00:00:21,027 --> 00:00:23,557
(Amy:)but I don't know why
we're even talking about this.

9
00:00:23,563 --> 00:00:25,293
(Amy:)Just apologize to them.

10
00:00:25,298 --> 00:00:28,898
(Sheldon:)Fine, if that's what it takes
to go on their dumb trip.

11
00:00:28,901 --> 00:00:32,071
(Amy:)Maybe you could try apologizing
because you actually feel bad.

12
00:00:32,071 --> 00:00:33,141
(Amy:)It's called empathy.

13
00:00:33,139 --> 00:00:35,569
(Amy:)It's something
you could work on.

14
00:00:35,575 --> 00:00:37,305
(Sheldon:)I have empathy.

15
00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:38,810
(Penny:)Watch.

16
00:00:38,811 --> 00:00:42,011
(Sheldon:)Leonard made me soup,
and I was mean to him.

17
00:00:45,284 --> 00:00:46,814
(Emily:)Great.

18
00:00:46,819 --> 00:00:50,759
(Amy:)Now try it as if this isn't
your first day as a person.

19
00:00:50,756 --> 00:00:52,826
(Leonard:)Fine.

20
00:00:52,825 --> 00:00:56,425
(Sheldon:)Leonard made me soup,
and I was mean to him.

21
00:00:56,429 --> 00:00:58,599
(Sheldon:)Hey, I felt a little something.

22
00:00:58,598 --> 00:00:59,968
(Sheldon:)Let me try again.

